# FiFy — Fashion RAG System: Folder Structure Plan

A multimodal fashion search engine that scrapes retail sites, embeds product images/text via CLIP, stores vectors in Qdrant, and serves results through a FastAPI backend with a React frontend.

---

## Open Questions

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Frontend Framework**: The spec recommends React + TailwindCSS. Do you want to go with that, or keep it plain HTML/CSS for now?

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Monorepo or Split?**: Should the frontend (`/frontend`) live inside this same repo, or do you want it as a separate repository?

> [!NOTE]
> **Your friend's modules** (CLIP Engine, Qdrant integration, validation pipeline) are included in the structure below. You can coordinate interface contracts at the clearly marked boundaries.

---

## Proposed Folder Structure

```
d:\FiFy\
│
├── README.md                        # Project overview & setup guide
├── system-idea.txt                  # Original spec (already here)
├── .env                             # Secrets: API keys, Qdrant URL, etc.
├── .env.example                     # Safe copy of .env to commit
├── .gitignore
├── requirements.txt                 # Python dependencies (backend)
│
├── backend/                         # FastAPI Application
│   ├── main.py                      # App entry point, mounts routers
│   ├── config.py                    # Settings loader (reads .env)
│   ├── database.py                  # SQLite setup (APScheduler job tracking)
│   │
│   ├── routers/                     # FastAPI route handlers
│   │   ├── search.py                # POST /search/image, POST /search/text
│   │   ├── products.py              # GET /products/{id}
│   │   └── admin.py                 # POST /admin/scrape/trigger, GET /admin/scrape/status
│   │
│   ├── services/                    # Business logic (orchestration layer)
│   │   ├── search_service.py        # Coordinates embedding → Qdrant query → response
│   │   ├── embedding_service.py     # CLIP model wrapper (image + text)
│   │   └── qdrant_service.py        # Qdrant client wrapper
│   │
│   ├── models/                      # Pydantic request/response schemas
│   │   ├── search.py                # SearchRequest, SearchResponse, ProductResult
│   │   └── job.py                   # ScrapeJobStatus
│   │
│   └── utils/
│       ├── validators.py            # Image size/type validation, text length checks
│       └── logger.py                # Structured logging setup
│
├── scraper/                         # Scraping & Ingestion Pipeline
│   ├── scheduler.py                 # APScheduler setup — cron jobs per site
│   ├── executor.py                  # Playwright-based scraper runner
│   ├── site_analyzer/
│   │   ├── agent.py                 # Site Analyzer LLM agent (Claude API)
│   │   └── prompt_templates.py      # Prompts sent to Claude for selector extraction
│   ├── pipeline/
│   │   ├── validator.py             # Data validation layer (price, URL, image check)
│   │   └── dead_letter.py           # Dead letter queue logging + retry logic
│   └── configs/                     # Auto-generated per-site scraping configs (JSON)
│       ├── asos.json
│       ├── zara.json
│       ├── hm.json
│       ├── uniqlo.json
│       └── zalando.json
│
├── embeddings/                      # CLIP Embedding Engine
│   ├── clip_model.py                # Model loader, singleton pattern
│   ├── image_embedder.py            # Image download → preprocess → encode → return vector
│   └── text_embedder.py             # Text string → encode → return vector
│
├── vector_db/                       # Qdrant Integration
│   ├── client.py                    # Qdrant client init
│   ├── schema.py                    # Collection creation, named vectors config
│   ├── indexer.py                   # Insert/upsert product points
│   └── searcher.py                  # Cosine similarity search + filter helpers
│
├── jobs/                            # Maintenance Background Jobs
│   ├── dead_link_checker.py         # Pings image URLs every 24h, sets is_active=false
│   └── config_invalidator.py        # Flags stale configs after 3 consecutive empty scrapes
│
├── data/                            # Local persistent data (gitignored except examples)
│   ├── url_hash_registry.db         # SQLite: tracks scraped URLs + hashes
│   ├── job_status.db                # SQLite: scraping job tracking
│   └── dead_letter.log              # Failed products awaiting retry
│
├── tests/                           # Test suite
│   ├── test_embedding.py            # CLIP output shape/value sanity checks
│   ├── test_search.py               # Search endpoint integration tests
│   ├── test_scraper.py              # Scraper config generation + execution tests
│   └── test_validation.py           # Data validation layer tests
│
└── frontend/                        # React + TailwindCSS SPA
    ├── package.json
    ├── index.html
    ├── src/
    │   ├── App.jsx                  # Root component, manages search state machine
    │   ├── main.jsx                 # ReactDOM entry point
    │   ├── components/
    │   │   ├── SearchBar.jsx        # Text input + search button
    │   │   ├── ImageUpload.jsx      # Drag-and-drop image upload zone
    │   │   ├── ProductCard.jsx      # Product card: image, name, brand, price, badge, link
    │   │   ├── ProductGrid.jsx      # Responsive grid layout for results
    │   │   └── SkeletonLoader.jsx   # Loading skeleton (1-3s wait state)
    │   ├── api/
    │   │   └── search.js            # API calls to FastAPI backend
    │   └── styles/
    │       └── index.css            # Global styles / Tailwind directives
    └── public/
        └── favicon.ico
```

