## Verification Plan

- `d:\FiFy\` root is clean — no scripts or logic at the top level
- All Python imports work (`backend` is importable as a package via `main.py`)
- `.env.example` committed; actual `.env` in `.gitignore`
- `scraper/configs/` starts empty; JSON files are generated at runtime
- `data/` folder is gitignored entirely (local SQLite DBs and logs)
